  "title": "Export finance in an era of global uncertainty",
  "summary": "According to the World Economic Forum’s latest Global Risks Report, uncertainty is shaping the global economic outlook for 2026. Geopolitical fragmentation, trade realignment, supply chain vulnerabilities, and macroeconomic volatility are redefining how capital moves across borders. In this environment, the ability to support global trade and cross-border financing becomes a structural differentiator for banks and a stabilising force for corporates navigating complexity.",
